      "Mobile-First Ergonomics (Thumb zone friendly)",
      "Cultural Minimalism (Subtle Indian motifs, not kitsch)",
      "Content is King (High quality fabric/work photos)",
      "Warmth over sterility (Stone greys instead of blue greys)"
